msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>`：使用 :ref:`电机测试功能 <connect-escs-and-"
"motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:90
#: 6e71e0efb49a49d597714d1d93c58235
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER <Q_M_THST_HOVER>`: 0.25, or below the expected hover "
"thrust percentage (low is safe)"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER <Q_M_THST_HOVER>`：0.25，或低于预期悬停推力百分比（低值较安全）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:93
