msgstr "ESC 响应非线性。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:415
#: fa7794a4145f49f381913feb22acb000
msgid "Very low setting for :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>` 设置过低。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:416
#: 83cfac5ec73948cabe0c9cbb3e1b3e65
msgid "Overloaded propellers or motors."
msgstr "螺旋桨或电机过载。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:417
#: 00ddb48229f14c6e91f23152fbc08b6c
msgid ""
"Autotuning a Tailsitter's pitch or yaw axis, or vectored yaw axis on "
"TiltRotor, since they require feed-forward."
msgstr "自动调参尾坐式的俯仰或偏航轴，或倾转旋翼的矢量偏航轴，因为这些需要前馈。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:419
#: 328c39447175472da727840edb157905
msgid "If QAUTOTUNE has failed you will need to re-do a manual tune."
msgstr "如果 QAUTOTUNE 失败，您将需要重新进行手动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:421
#: df6c4caee21f4dd4b22f1fe77cc34d85
