#: a5f46cf2cf8c43e7a10f581e85b77be4
msgid ""
"An increase in the values of :ref:`Q_A_ANG_PIT_P <Q_A_ANG_PIT_P>` and "
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_RLL_P <Q_A_ANG_RLL_P>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_PIT_P <Q_A_ANG_PIT_P>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_ANG_RLL_P <Q_A_ANG_RLL_P>` "
"值增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:424
#: 86b3c61ef2f84307ae1eb2fcd4652be9
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_D <Q_A_RAT_PIT_D>` and :ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_D "
"<Q_A_RAT_RLL_D>` are larger than :ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_MIN_D <Q_AUTOTUNE_MIN_D>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_D <Q_A_RAT_PIT_D>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_D <Q_A_RAT_RLL_D>` "
"大于 :ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_MIN_D <Q_AUTOTUNE_MIN_D>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:426
#: 49bf77cac7724f259fb4bccb215a2c9c
msgid ""
"QAUTOTUNE will attempt to tune each axis as tight as the aircraft can "
"tolerate. In some aircraft this can be unnecessarily responsive. A guide for"
" most aircraft:"
msgstr "QAUTOTUNE 将尝试将每个轴调参到飞行器能承受的最紧状态。在某些飞行器上，这可能会导致不必要的灵敏响应。大多数飞行器的参考值："

