#: 5b382d81c86843b6842c0b49003c35da
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_YAW_P <Q_A_ANG_YAW_P>` should be reduced from 10 to 6"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_YAW_P <Q_A_ANG_YAW_P>` 应从 10 降低到 6"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:431
#: 7b337b83aa2849018e58dd3cc22df76a
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` should be reduced from 1 to 0.5"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` 应从 1 降低到 0.5"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:432
#: 3af239493b9f40a0bce3eb9d76b3d60b
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I <Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>`: :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` x"
" 0.1"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I <Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>`：:ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` × "
"0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:434
#: 4afddbb564c244e09ab8ee2465f020aa
msgid ""
"These values should only be changed if QAUTOTUNE produces higher values. "
"Small aerobatic aircraft may prefer to keep these values as high as "
"possible."
msgstr "这些值仅在 QAUTOTUNE 产生更高值时才应更改。小型特技飞行器可能倾向于保持这些值尽可能高。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:437
#: a43d0e32ff544e8a9ee74726fa233714
msgid "Step 13: Setting the input shaping parameters"
msgstr "第 13 步：设置输入整形参数"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:439
#: 06c007f16efd453496178194746a2b85
msgid ""
"QuadPlane has a set of parameters that define the way the aircraft feels to "
"fly. This allows the aircraft to be set up with a very aggressive tune but "
"still feel like a very docile and friendly aircraft to fly."
msgstr "四旋翼飞机有一组参数定义飞行器的飞行手感。这允许飞行器以非常激进的调参结果设置，但仍然感觉像一架非常温和、友好的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:441
#: 1217bf6d943049b6ab11915933169fef
msgid "The most important of these parameters is:"
msgstr "这些参数中最重要的是："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:443
#: 6ee116a69d674693939dfccbbcccef52
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>`: yaw rate x 45 degrees/s"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>`：偏航速率 × 45 度/秒"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:444
#: 8fff607ab37841cda1ebe353832dc94c
msgid ":ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX <Q_ANGLE_MAX>`:  maximum lean angle"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX <Q_ANGLE_MAX>`：最大倾斜角"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:445
#: 424f83c4059c4606958ff5c0f2fa3236
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`: Pitch rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`：俯仰速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:446
#: aeede5822452413ab879a7c784c3cb8b
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>`: Roll rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>`：横滚速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:447
#: ace322d2ecd7485a92e0a75818e054b0
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`: Yaw rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`：偏航速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:448
#: 2676a0e4e46f4cefbf6acec2aa85cc44
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>`: Aircraft smoothing time"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>`：飞行器平滑时间"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:450
#: 105552157a2b4ae4bd507be05c91ef50
msgid ""
"QAUTOTUNE mode tuning will set the :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`,"
" :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>` and :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX "
"<Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` parameters to their maximum based on measurements done "
"during the QAUTOTUNE tests. These values should not be increased beyond what"
" QAUTOTUNE suggests without careful testing. In most cases pilots will want "
"to reduce these values significantly."
msgstr ""
"QAUTOTUNE 模式调参将根据 QAUTOTUNE 测试期间的测量值，将 :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` 参数设置为最大值。这些值不应超出 QAUTOTUNE "
"建议的范围而不经过仔细测试。在大多数情况下，飞手会希望显著降低这些值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:452
#: d579d18cb908477f854886e4cfc1a354
msgid ""
"The Quick VTOL Tune LUA Applet will not adjust these from defaults and you "
"may adjust them to get the feel you desire."
msgstr "Quick VTOL Tune LUA 小程序不会从默认值调整这些参数，您可以根据所需手感进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:454
#: 5191e258b7a745d08212aa6da32aa864
msgid ""
"For aircraft designed to carry large directly mounted payloads, the maximum "
"values of :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`, :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX "
"<Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>` and :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` should be "
"reduced based on the minimum and maximum takeoff weight (TOW):"
msgstr ""
"对于设计为直接安装大型载荷的飞行器，:ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` 的最大值应根据最小和最大起飞重量（TOW）进行缩减："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:456
#: 987f6901f9ab433fb07545c81e56daaf
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>` × (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:457
#: 63f4dae7419240298144502889a34d8d
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>` × (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:458
#: d7445d6c9ee3455886d956d51b15913f
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` × (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:460
#: 44f032ba9e5945c7970f37a51241d734
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` should be set to be approximately 0.5 x"
" :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` / 4500 to ensure that the aircraft"
" can achieve full yaw rate in approximately half a second."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` 应设置为约 0.5 × :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX "
"<Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` / 4500，以确保飞行器能在约半秒内达到最大偏航速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:462
#: ef3f803f8dd544ea99f07b7a889a7968
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>` may be increased to provide a very "
"smooth feeling on the sticks at the expense of a slower reaction time."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>` 可以增加，以牺牲较慢的响应时间为代价，在摇杆上提供非常平滑的手感。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:464
#: 6a9563dc85d549038186623023d3ca43
msgid ""
"Aerobatic aircraft should keep the :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`,"
" :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>` and :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX "
"<Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` provided by QAUTOTUNE and reduce :ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC "
"<Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>` to achieve the stick feel desired by the pilot."
msgstr ""
"特技飞行器应保留 QAUTOTUNE 提供的 :ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<Q_A_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`，并降低 :ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC "
"<Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>` 以获得飞手所需的摇杆手感。"

